  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE:**__\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Option (1): + and ÷**\n\nGiven equation: 12 **+** 6 × 4 - 6 **÷** 3 = 5\n\nInterchanged equation is : __**12 ÷ 6 **__× 4 - 6 **+** 3 = 5\n\n**⇒ __2 × 4__** - 6 + 3 = 5\n\n⇒ 8 - 6 + 3 = 5\n\n⇒ __**8 + 3**__ - 6 = 5\n\n⇒ 11 - 6 = 5\n\n⇒ **5 = 5**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option (2): ÷ and ×**\n\nGiven equation: 12 + 6 **×** 4 - 6 **÷** 3 = 5\n\nInterchanged equation is: 12 + __**6 ÷ 4**__ - 6 **×** 3 = 5\n\n⇒ 12 + 1.5 -__** 6 × 3 **__= 5\n\n⇒ __**12 + 1.5 **__- 18 = 5\n\n⇒ 13.5 - 18 = 5\n\n⇒ __**- 4.5 ≠ 5**__\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (3): × and +**\n\nGiven equation: 12 **+** 6 **×** 4 - 6 ÷ 3 = 5\n\nInterchanged equation is: 12 **×** 6 **+** 4 - __**6 ÷ 3**__ = 5\n\n⇒ __**12 × 6**__ + 4 - 2 = 5\n\n⇒ __**72 + 4**__ - 2 = 5\n\n⇒ 76 - 2 = 5\n\n⇒ **74 ≠ 5**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (4): - and ÷**\n\nGiven equation: 12 + 6 × 4 **-** 6 **÷** 3 = 5\n\nInterchanged equation is: 12 + 6 × **4 ÷ 6** **-** 3 = 5\n\n⇒ 12 + __**6 × 0.66 **__- 3 = 5\n\n⇒ __**12 + 4**__ - 3 = 5\n\n⇒ 16 - 3 = 5\n\n⇒ **13 ≠ 5**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"+ and ÷\"**.",
